sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Patient
    participant T as Phone line
    participant V as Voice engine
    participant L as AI brain
    participant M as Safety rules
    participant E as EMIS
    P->>T: Calls practice
    T->>V: Audio stream
    V->>L: Transcript
